in\x20must\x20be\x20a\x20quarter,\x20and\x20the\x20first\x20coin\x20is\x20a\x20nickel.\x0a\x0aAnswer:\x20A\x20quarter\x20and\x20a\x20nickel.\x0a\x0a\x0a\x0a\x0aQuestion\x20:\x0aA\x20man\x20is\x20looking\x20at\x20a\x20photograph.\x20Someone\x20asks\x20him,\x20\x22Who\x20are\x20you\x20looking\x20at?\x22\x20He\x20replies,\x20\x22Brothers\x20and\x20sisters\x20I\x20have\x20none,\x20but\x20that\x20man\x27s\x20father\x20is\x20my\x20father\x27s\x20son.\x22\x20Who\x20is\x20in\x20the\x20photograph?\x0a\x0aChain\x20of\x20Thought:\x0a\x0a\x22My\x20father\x27s\x20son\x22\x20is\x20himself.\x0aSo,\x20the\x20man\x20is\x20saying,\x20\x22That\x20man\x27s\x20father\x20is\x20me.\x22\x0aIf\x20he\x20is\x20the\x20father\x20of\x20the\x20man\x20in\x20the\x20photograph,\x20then\x20the\x20man\x20in\x20the\x20photograph\x20is\x20his\x20son.\x0a\x0aAnswer:\x20His\x20son.\x0a\x0a\x0a\x0a\x0aQuestion\x20:\x0aThere\x20are\x20three\x20light\x20switches\x20outside\x20a\x20room.\x20Only\x20one\x20of\x20them\x20controls\x20the\x20light\x20inside.\x20The\x20door\x20to\x20the\x20room\x20is\x20closed,\x20and\x20you\x20cannot\x20see\x20inside.\x20You\x20can\x20manipulate\x20the\x20switches\x20however\x20you\x20want,\x20but\x20you\x20can\x20only\x20open\x20the\x20door\x20once.\x20How\x20can\x20you\x20determine\x20which\x20switch\x20controls\x20the\x20light?\x0a\x0aChain\x20of\x20Thought:\x0a\x0aFlip\x20switch\x20#1\x20on\x20and\x20leave\x20it\x20on\x20for\x20a\x20few\x20minutes.\x0aTurn\x20switch\x20#1\x20off.\x0aFlip\x20switch\x20#2\x20on.\x0aOpen\x20the\x20door.\x0aIf\x20the\x20light\x20is\x20on,\x20switch\x20#2\x20controls\x20it.\x0aIf\x20the\x20light\x20is\x20off,\x20feel\x20the\x20light\x20bulb.\x20If\x20it\x27s\x20warm,\x20switch\x20#1\x20controls\x20it\x20(because\x20it\x20was\x20on\x20for\x20a\x20while).\x0aIf\x20the\x20light\x20is\x20off\x20and\x20the\x20bulb\x20is\x20cold,\x20switch\x20#3\x20controls\x20it\x20(because\x20it\x20was\x20never\x20turned\x20on).\x0a\x0aAnswer:\x20By\x20using\x20a\x20c